<title>UK: Telkom at $32.875 in London at 0839 GMT.</title>
<headline>Telkom at $32.875 in London at 0839 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telkom traded at $32.875 and London at 0839 GMT on Wednesday. It recorded the day's low of $32.875 and the day's high of $33.525.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Tuesday $33.75. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
